<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>

  <title>Home | Weisburg</title>

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>

  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
</head>
<body class="home-body">

  <!-- Navigation -->
  <%- include("partials/nav") %>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>Hi, I'm Connor</h1>
    <img
      src="/images/Photo_4.jpg"
      alt="Connor Weisburg"
      class="profile-photo"
    />
    <p>A creative exploring music, systems, and storytelling.</p>

    <a class="cta" href="#story">Explore Me</a>
  </section>

  <div class="content">

    <!-- My Story -->
    <section id="story" class="card green-card">
      <h2>My Story</h2>
      <p>
        I grew up in Colorado, dreaming of being a cowboy. I was a scrappy kid who was obsessed with music, puzzles, and stories. Eventually, I chased those obsessions west to Los Angeles.
        
        There are secret codes and symbols out here. There are hidden messages wrapped in sacred geometry and buried along forgotten melodies. There are one thousand epiphanies waiting to be unlocked with the right key. My purpose is to uncover the wonder that has been lost.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Philosophy -->
    <section class="card blue-card">
      <h2>Philosophy</h2>
      <p>
        I value depth over speed, consistency over intensity,
        and intention over reaction. Do what you must do and do it well. 
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- Snapshots -->
    <section class="card brown-card">
      <h2>Snapshots</h2>

      <div class="snapshot-grid">
        <div class="snapshot">
          <img src="/images/photo_2.JPG" alt="Photo 2">
        </div>

        <div class="snapshot">
          <img src="/images/Sunglasses_suit.png" alt="Sunglasses Suit">
        </div>

        <div class="snapshot">
          <img src="/images/self_bass_studio.png" alt="Bass Studio">
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Closing -->
    <section class="card accent-card">
      <h2>What this is</h2>
      <p>
        A living record of work, ideas, and exploration.
      </p>
    </section>

  </div>

</body>
</html>